--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Complete corresponding source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The parsing core is published alongside this Actor as `sitemap_core/`, and its
canonical development copy is the `sitemap-core` package in the same repository.
The vendored copy inside `src/sitemap_core/` is generated by `sync_core.py`,
which records a SHA-256 manifest of every file it copies; `python sync_core.py
--check` fails if the two have drifted. That check exists so the promise "same
parser, same tests, same output schema" cannot quietly stop being true.

